@startuml order-crud

title Order Flow

actor User
actor Admin
participant "Browser" as Browser
participant "API\n(Endpoint)" as API
participant "Handler\n(Use Case)" as Handler
participant "Redis\n(ICacher)" as Redis
participant "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "ECPay\nLogistics" as ECPay
participant "LinePay /\nPayPal" as PayGateway
participant "Kafka\n(Outbox)" as Kafka
participant "Email\nService" as Email

== Step 1: 物流選擇 ==

User -> API : POST /orders/logistics/start\n{ receiverName, receiverPhone, goodsAmount }
API -> Handler : StartLogisticsSelectionCommand(userId)
Handler -> Redis : SetAsync(session:{token} → userId, TTL 15min)
Handler --> API : { token }
API -> ECPay : GetSelectionFormHtmlAsync\n(clientReplyUrl = /ecpay/client-reply?token=xxx)
ECPay --> API : HTML form
API --> Browser : 200 text/html

Browser -> ECPay : 整頁導向 ECPay 門市選擇頁
User -> ECPay : 選擇門市
ECPay -> API : POST /ecpay/client-reply?token=xxx\n(browser POST, FormData: ResultData)
API -> Redis : GetAsync(session:{token}) → userId
API -> ECPay : DecryptClientReply(ResultData)
API -> Redis : SetAsync(logistics:{userId} → LogisticsCacheData, TTL 15min)
API -> Redis : RemoveAsync(session:{token})
API --> Browser : 302 Redirect → {FrontendDomain}/checkout?logistics=done

Browser -> API : GET /orders/logistics/status
API -> Redis : GetAsync(logistics:{userId})
Redis --> API : LogisticsCacheData
API --> Browser : 200 { isReady: true, logisticsSubType, storeName/address }

== Step 2: 下訂單 ==

User -> API : POST /orders\n{ paymentMethod, receiverName, receiverPhone }
API -> Handler : CreateOrderCommand

Handler -> Redis : GetAsync(logistics:{userId})
Redis --> Handler : LogisticsCacheData

Handler -> DB : GetByUserIdAsync(cart)
DB --> Handler : Cart + Items

loop Each cart item
  Handler -> DB : GetSkuDetailsAsync(skuId)
  DB --> Handler : Product + Variant + Sku
  Handler -> Handler : sku.DeductStock(quantity)
  Handler -> DB : productRepository.Update
end

Handler -> DB : AddAsync(Order)
Handler -> DB : AddAsync(Payment, status=Pending, url=null)
Handler -> DB : AddAsync(Shipment CVS/Home)
Handler -> DB : cart.Clear()

Handler -> DB : SaveChangesAsync\n(含樂觀鎖重試，最多 3 次)
note right: 若全部失敗 → 回傳 stock_conflict 錯誤\n此時 gateway 尚未呼叫

Handler -> PayGateway : RequestAsync(paymentMethod, order)
PayGateway --> Handler : { paymentUrl }

Handler -> Handler : payment.SetPaymentUrl(url)
Handler -> DB : SaveChangesAsync

Handler -> Redis : RemoveAsync(cart:{userId})
Handler -> Redis : RemoveAsync(logistics:{userId})

Handler --> API : { orderId, totalAmount, paymentUrl }
API --> User : 201 { orderId, totalAmount, paymentUrl }

User -> Browser : 導向 paymentUrl（LinePay / PayPal 付款頁）

== Step 3a: 付款回調（LinePay）==

Browser -> API : GET /payments/linepay/confirm\n?transactionId=xxx&orderId=xxx
API -> DB : GetByOrderIdAsync(payment)
API -> PayGateway : ConfirmPaymentAsync(transactionId, amount)
PayGateway --> API : { returnCode: "0000" }
API -> Handler : ConfirmPaymentCommand(orderId, transactionId)
Handler -> Handler : payment.MarkAsPaid(transactionId)\norder.MarkAsPaid()
Handler -> DB : SaveChangesAsync\n→ PaymentPaidEvent → OutboxEvent
API --> Browser : 302 Redirect → {FrontendDomain}/orders/{orderId}?payment=success

Kafka -> Email : payment.paid\n→ 寄送付款成功通知信

== Step 3b: 付款回調（PayPal）==

Browser -> API : GET /payments/paypal/return\n?token=xxx&orderId=xxx
API -> DB : GetByOrderIdAsync(payment)
API -> PayGateway : ConfirmAsync(token)
PayGateway --> API : { captureId }
API -> Handler : ConfirmPaymentCommand(orderId, captureId)
Handler -> Handler : payment.MarkAsPaid(captureId)\norder.MarkAsPaid()
Handler -> DB : SaveChangesAsync\n→ PaymentPaidEvent → OutboxEvent
API --> Browser : 302 Redirect → {FrontendDomain}/orders/{orderId}?payment=success

Kafka -> Email : payment.paid\n→ 寄送付款成功通知信

== Step 4: 出貨（Admin）==

Admin -> API : POST /admin/orders/{orderId}/ship
API -> Handler : GetShipmentByOrderIdQuery(orderId)
DB --> API : Shipment (含 TempLogisticsID)
API -> ECPay : CreateByTempTradeAsync(tempLogisticsId, merchantTradeNo)
ECPay --> API : { RtnCode: 1, LogisticsID: "xxx" }
API -> Handler : MarkOrderAsShippedCommand(orderId, realLogisticsId)
Handler -> Handler : order.MarkAsShipped()\nshipment.AssignRealLogisticsId()\nshipment.UpdateStatus("300", "出貨中")
Handler -> DB : SaveChangesAsync\n→ OrderShippedEvent → OutboxEvent
Handler --> API : NoContent
API --> Admin : 200 { logisticsId, logisticsSubType }

Kafka -> Email : order.shipped\n→ 寄送出貨通知信（含門市/地址資訊）

== Step 5: 完成訂單（Admin）==

Admin -> API : POST /admin/orders/{orderId}/complete
API -> Handler : MarkOrderAsCompletedCommand(orderId)
Handler -> DB : GetByIdAsync(order)
Handler -> DB : GetByOrderIdAsync(shipment)
Handler -> Handler : order.MarkAsCompleted()\nshipment.MarkAsCompleted()
Handler -> DB : SaveChangesAsync
Handler --> API : NoContent
API --> Admin : 204

== Read Orders ==

User -> API : GET /orders
API -> Handler : GetOrdersQuery(userId)
Handler -> DB : GetByUserIdAsync(userId, page, size)
DB --> Handler : (orders, totalCount)
Handler --> API : PagedResponse
API --> User : 200 PagedResponse

User -> API : GET /orders/{orderId}
API -> Handler : GetOrderByIdQuery(orderId, userId)
Handler -> DB : GetByIdAsync(orderId)
DB --> Handler : Order
Handler --> API : OrderResponse
API --> User : 200 OrderResponse

@enduml
